 857  8419              ;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 858  8419              ; Locate EasySD VDT without hardcoding its assembler-dependent address.
 859  8419              ;
 860  8419              ; EasySD 1.1 keeps the selected SD1/SD2 LBA at #3C90/#3C94 in the driver
 861  8419              ; page. We scan aligned xx00 candidates and require their selected record(s)
 862  8419              ; to contain the same four bytes. This keeps the switcher independent of the
 863  8419              ; exact length of SD_DRIVER.
 864  8419              ;
 865  8419              ; OUT HL = VDT base, carry clear
 866  8419              ;     carry set = not found
 867  8419              ;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
